e:0.95rem; color:#666; line-height:1.7; padding:8px 0 8px 22px; position:relative;\"><span style=\"position:absolute;left:0;top:16px;width:8px;height:8px;background:#1380da;border-radius:50%;display:inline-block;\"></span><strong style=\"color:#03325e;\">Seal and gasket profiles</strong> &mdash; flexible or semi-rigid continuous profiles for sealing, cushioning, and edge protection</li>\n<li style=\"font-family:'Lora',serif; font-size:0.95rem; color:#666; line-height:1.7; padding:8px 0 8px 22px; position:relative;\"><span style=\"position:absolute;left:0;top:16px;width:8px;height:8px;background:#1380da;border-radius:50%;display:inline-block;\"></span><strong style=\"color:#03325e;\">Electrical conduit and cable management</strong> &mdash; custom plastic channel and duct profiles for wire management</li>\n<li style=\"font-family:'Lora',serif; font-size:0.95rem; color:#666; line-height:1.7; padding:8px 0 8px 22px; position:relative;\"><span style=\"position:absolute;left:0;top:16px;width:8px;height:8px;background:#1380da;border-radius:50%;display:inline-block;\"></span><strong style=\"color:#03325e;\">Medical and laboratory tubing</strong> &mdash; precision-bore tubing in FDA-compliant materials for fluid handling and laboratory applications</li>\n<li style=\"font-family:'Lora',serif; font-size:0.95rem; color:#666; line-height:1.7; padding:8px 0 8px 22px; position:relative;\"><span style=\"position:absolute;left:0;top:16px;width:8px;height:8px;background:#1380da;border-radius:50%;display:inline-block;\"></span><strong style=\"color:#03325e;\">Custom trim and edge profiles</strong> &mdash; decorative and protective edge trim in custom cross-sections</li>\n<li style=\"font-family:'Lora',serif; font-size:0.95rem; color:#666; line-height:1.7; padding:8px 0 8px 22px; position:relative;\"><span style=\"position:absolute;left:0;top:16px;width:8px;height:8px;background:#1380da;border-radius:50%;display:inline-block;\"></span><strong style=\"color:#03325e;\">Replacement profil